  "architecture_notes": [
    "nq-core owns domain, policy, ports and application services and must not depend on JDBC",
    "nq-infra owns JDBC and repository adapters",
    "exchange adapters are infrastructure boundaries and do not define platform domain semantics",
    "tests are governed by review and existing test/ArchUnit checks, not folded into the production Shadow baseline"
  ]
